      "speaker": "Velvet",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "Got the key. Their batch's dead. Thanks, V.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\vk001\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\vk001_03_velvet_return.wem",
      "duration_ms": 3920,
      "beat": "opening",
      "female_lipsync_animation": "f_816D504FA1E58EA3",
      "male_lipsync_animation": "m_816D504FA1E58EA3"
    },
    {
      "key": "vk001_03_v_question",
      "string_id": "14076458176472055141",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Velvet",
      "text": "That message in the archive. Who was it for?",
      "audio_path": "mod\\vk001\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\vk001_03_v_question_f.wem",
      "duration_ms": 3440,
      "beat": "opening",
      "male_audio_path": "mod\\vk001\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\vk001_03_v_question_m.wem",
      "female_lipsync_animation": "f_C359A02198427D65",
      "male_lipsync_animation": "m_C359A02198427D65"
    },
    {
      "key": "vk001_03_velvet_friend",
      "string_id": "11261539277534521313",
      "speaker": "Velvet",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "A friend. Her partner bought her a mood regulator. Said she wasn't sleeping. That she worried too much.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\vk001\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\vk001_03_velvet_friend.wem",
      "duration_ms": 6000,
      "beat": "opening",
      "female_lipsync_animation": "f_9C49064E858DE7E1",
      "male_lipsync_animation": "m_9C49064E858DE7E1"
    },
    {
      "key": "vk001_03_velvet_cost",
      "string_id": "3851357283064953564",
      "speaker": "Velvet",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "Whenever she got angry with him, it pushed her back toward feeling good. She'd tell me something he'd done, then start apologising for bringing it up.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\vk001\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\vk001_03_velvet_cost.wem",
      "duration_ms": 8240,
      "beat": "opening",
      "female_lipsync_animation": "f_3572C50B28333ADC",
      "male_lipsync_animation": "m_3572C50B28333ADC"
    },
    {
      "key": "vk001_03_velvet_truth",
      "string_id": "209976722909800386",
      "speaker": "Velvet",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "She knew it was happening. Told me she couldn't stay angry long enough to leave. That's what I built Heartbreaker for.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\vk001\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\vk001_03_velvet_truth.wem",
      "duration_ms": 6650,
      "beat": "opening",
      "female_lipsync_animation": "f_02E9FCB78C23A7C2",
      "male_lipsync_animation": "m_02E9FCB78C23A7C2"
    },
    {
      "key": "vk001_03_v_sincere",
      "string_id": "3447555177663139336",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Velvet",
      "text": "You gave her a chance to get out.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\vk001\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\vk001_03_v_sincere_f.wem",
      "duration_ms": 1920,
      "beat": "sincere",
      "male_audio_path": "mod\\vk001\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\vk001_03_v_sincere_m.wem",
      "female_lipsync_animation": "f_2FD82D2B0C2B8E08",
      "male_lipsync_animation": "m_2FD82D2B0C2B8E08"
    },
    {
      "key": "vk001_03_velvet_sincere",
      "string_id": "581051657885304764",
      "speaker": "Velvet",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "She got herself out. Just needed her head clear long enough. I'm glad I could give her that.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\vk001\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\vk001_03_velvet_sincere.wem",
      "duration_ms": 5680,
      "beat": "sincere",
      "female_lipsync_animation": "f_08104F678067C7BC",
      "male_lipsync_animation": "m_08104F678067C7BC"
    },
    {
      "key": "vk001_03_v_tease",
      "string_id": "12210822694412636017",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Velvet",
      "text": "Still doesn't explain the hearts and ribbons.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\vk001\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\vk001_03_v_tease_f.wem",
      "duration_ms": 2720,
      "beat": "tease",
      "male_audio_path": "mod\\vk001\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\vk001_03_v_tease_m.wem",
      "female_lipsync_animation": "f_A9758E8B7BBE4F71",
      "male_lipsync_animation": "m_A9758E8B7BBE4F71"
    },
    {
      "key": "vk001_03_velvet_tease",
      "string_id": "13302109527002221941",
      "speaker": "Velvet",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "Those were in my version, too. I'm keeping them.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\vk001\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\vk001_03_velvet_tease.wem",
      "duration_ms": 3600,
      "beat": "tease",
      "female_lipsync_animation": "f_B89A9623204E8D75",
      "male_lipsync_animation": "m_B89A9623204E8D75"
    },
    {
      "key": "vk001_03_v_tease_soft",
      "string_id": "10132533625446414382",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Velvet",
      "text": "Fair enough. Your work.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\vk001\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\vk001_03_v_tease_soft_f.wem",
      "duration_ms": 2320,
      "beat": "tease",
      "male_audio_path": "mod\\vk001\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\vk001_03_v_tease_soft_m.wem",
      "female_lipsync_animation": "f_8C9DFDA5DB6F382E",
      "male_lipsync_animation": "m_8C9DFDA5DB6F382E"
    },
    {
      "key": "vk001_03_v_friend",
      "string_id": "8498838853296619757",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Velvet",
      "text": "She doing okay now?",
      "audio_path": "mod\\vk001\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\vk001_03_v_friend_f.wem",
      "duration_ms": 1840,
      "beat": "friend",
      "male_audio_path": "mod\\vk001\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\vk001_03_v_friend_m.wem",
      "female_lipsync_animation": "f_75F1F0E8860880ED",
      "male_lipsync_animation": "m_75F1F0E8860880ED"
